{"unit_id":"wonaren__dsh-upgrade#card-zh","repo":"wonaren/dsh-upgrade","commit":"d7adedbb7092ecce6743d9c148297cafbdbe5667","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-upgrade 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的版本管理插件，在侧栏底部加入入口，并由服务端接口提供版本信息和升级状态。它可检查当前、稳定版及 alpha 版本，查看历史版本，预检已安装插件与目标 DSH 版本的兼容性，并在升级前备份 Web profile、安装指定版本和重启服务。适合希望从网页界面管理 DSH 更新、回滚和服务重启的用户。查询版本会访问 npm 镜像或官方注册表；升级使用本机全局 npm，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1610-1617","lib/index.js:498-590","lib/index.js:355-493"]}
{"unit_id":"wonaren__dsh-upgrade#card-en","repo":"wonaren/dsh-upgrade","commit":"d7adedbb7092ecce6743d9c148297cafbdbe5667","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-upgrade adds a DSH Web sidebar panel to check releases and plugin compatibility. It can back up the Web profile, install a selected DSH version with global npm, and restart the service. Version checks use an npm registry; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1610-1617","lib/index.js:498-590","lib/index.js:355-493"]}
